イさん》"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" https://www.wani.co.jp/event.php?id=7650"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 《BOMBさん》"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" https://bombweb.jp/next/bomb/"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" ぜひお手に取っていただけたら嬉しいです😊\n こちらがアップトゥボーイさんでとっていただいたオフショットです💗 "},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/images/14/c45/0a80e95c6738a7e18bedf1bd3b55e.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/images/14/c45/0a80e95c6738a7e18bedf1bd3b55e-01.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" あなたともし同じクラスなら… \n ってかんじですかねぇ😚"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 【前回の日向坂で会いましょう】\n “熱で変な夢見る”ってよく言うじゃないですか。\n 冒頭で申し上げた通り私先日コロナにかかってしまったわけなのですが、変な夢を見ずに済んだんです！その秘密（？）が前回の放送にありますのでぜひぜひチェックしてみてください❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 毎日匂いをクンカクンカしながら一緒に寝てます🛌💤"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 前回の私のブログで“宝物”についてお話させていただいたと思うのですが、そんな私の人生で初めての宝物がこちらです💁‍♀️ "},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/images/14/c45/0a80e95c6738a7e18bedf1bd3b55e-02.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" クマのぬいぐるみが「ホワイト」\n イヌのぬいぐるみが「りりな」\n バクのぬいぐるみが《未定》\n いい名前何かないかな…\n 今度決めたいと思います笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 犬についている首輪は、私の姉が私が小学生の頃編んで作ってくれたものです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":" 今回も最後まで読んでいただきありがとうございました！\n 明日は可愛い可愛いきらりんの番ですよ✨"}],"source":"official"},"ofc-hina-54721":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"18歳"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"宮地すみれです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おもてなし会から一年を迎えたり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがたいことに\n『見たことない魔物』のMVも\n200万回も再生していただいたりと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これまでの活動を思い出す機会の多かった\nそんな一週間でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"応援してくださる皆さんに\n今日も感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます(՞ . .՞)\""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世界卓球団体戦も開幕しましたね🏓"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"熱い戦いに目が離せません､､､！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202402/mob3OKQ9s.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202402/mobTUHI1e.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぽかぽかな最近のわたしです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暖かくなってきましたね。\n綺麗な青空届いてるかな~？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202402/mobD7bZU4.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://cdn.hinatazaka46.com/files/14/diary/official/member/moblog/202402/mobxBoZhX.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また会いたいな､､､"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニャオハの可愛さに終始にこにこでした☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めまして"},{"type":"break"},{"typ